{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    " (add-on is off)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（插件已停用）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Add a TMDB key (Settings → Integrations): without one, titles from add-on catalogues can't be placed, so only TMDB-sourced rows are filtered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 添加 TMDB 密钥（设置 → 集成）：没有密钥时无法判断插件目录中的影片来源，因此只会筛选来自 TMDB 的栏目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " Without a TMDB key (Settings → Integrations) anime and cartoons can't be told apart, so all animation is hidden while either is off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 没有 TMDB 密钥（设置 → 集成）时无法区分动漫和卡通，因此只要其中一项关闭，所有动画都会被隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ catalogues": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 目录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ free on this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机剩余 %@"
          }
        }
