    "Add, reorder, switch off and configure your Stremio add-ons.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加、排序、停用和配置你的 Stremio 插件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add-on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add-on URL": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插件地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add-on link (https:// or stremio://)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插件链接（https:// 或 stremio://）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add-ons": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add-ons are used from top to bottom. That sets the order of Home rows, search results and sources, so put the ones you prefer first. Switch an add-on off to skip it without removing it. Tap Edit to drag them into order; swipe left to remove one.\n\nThe gear opens an add-on's setup page in your browser. After changing settings there, copy the new add-on link it gives you, add it below, then remove the old one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插件按从上到下的顺序使用，这决定了首页栏目、搜索结果和片源的排序，所以把你偏好的放在最前面。停用插件可以跳过它而不删除。点「编辑」可拖动排序；左滑可删除。\n\n齿轮图标会在浏览器中打开插件的设置页。在那里改完设置后，复制它给出的新插件链接，在下方添加，然后删除旧的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add-ons reloaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插件已重新加载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Added": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Added %@, but it doesn't identify itself as AIOMetadata. Switch it on under Other add-ons.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已添加 %@，但它未标明自己是 AIOMetadata。请在「其他插件」中启用它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adding…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds an OpenSubtitles list to the player's subtitle panel (no account needed). If your default language isn't in the file, the best match is loaded automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在播放器的字幕面板中添加 OpenSubtitles 列表（无需账户）。如果文件里没有你的默认语言，会自动加载最匹配的字幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Airs on %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "播出平台：%@"
