    "Catalogues are set up on the add-on's own page. After changing them there, copy the new add-on link, add it in Settings → Add-ons and remove the old one, or just reload if the link didn't change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目录在插件自己的页面上设置。在那里修改后，复制新的插件链接，在「设置 → 插件」中添加并删除旧的；如果链接没变，直接重新加载即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Catalogues come from your add-ons. Switching one off here hides its row; the add-on itself stays installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
