          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Network icons make one small request per visible poster. Logos come from TMDB, TheTVDB and Metahub and are cached after the first lookup. Landscape layout turns the app sideways into the iPad-style sidebar layout when you rotate your iPhone. Off keeps the app portrait-only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络图标会为每张可见海报发起一次小请求。台标来自 TMDB、TheTVDB 和 Metahub，首次查询后会缓存。横屏布局会在你旋转 iPhone 时把 App 变成 iPad 风格的侧边栏布局。关闭后 App 保持竖屏。"
