    "Off by default. When off, torrent sources are hidden and nothing P2P is started. Debrid and direct links are never affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。关闭时种子片源会被隐藏，也不会启动任何 P2P 连接。Debrid 和直链不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default: a search names exactly what you're after. Turn it on to apply the categories above to search too. Titles you added yourself (Continue Watching, your library) are never hidden.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭：搜索会精确命中你要找的内容。开启后，上方的分类也会应用于搜索。你自己添加的影片（继续观看、媒体库）永远不会被隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Older or newer?": {
      "localizations": {
