        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已暂停 · 点按继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Peak hour: %@ – %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高峰时段：%@ – %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pear uses your own free API keys. They stay on this device, and you can add or change them later in Settings → Integrations.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pear 使用你自己的免费 API 密钥。它们会留在本机，之后可在「设置 → 集成」中添加或更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pear. brings what you watch into one place: your library and watch history, trending and Explore pages, recommendations, and the streams from the add-ons you install, all in a native iOS player with Picture in Picture, subtitles and skip-intro buttons. Everything is saved per profile and stays on your device unless you connect a service.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pear. 把你看的内容集中到一处：媒体库与观看记录、热门与发现页、推荐，以及你安装的插件提供的片源，全部在一个原生 iOS 播放器中呈现，支持画中画、字幕和跳过片头按钮。所有内容按用户分别保存，除非你连接服务，否则都留在本机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pear. doesn't host, provide or index any media. Sources come only from the add-ons and links you choose to add.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pear. 不托管、不提供也不索引任何媒体。片源只来自你选择添加的插件和链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pear. is not affiliated with MDBList.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pear. 与 MDBList 无关联。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pear. is not affiliated with or endorsed by Simkl.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pear. 与 Simkl 无关联，也未获其认可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pear. uses FFmpeg. Full licence texts and the source of the exact build are in the FFmpegBuild repository.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pear. 使用 FFmpeg。完整许可证文本和确切构建源码见 FFmpegBuild 仓库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Peer-to-peer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "P2P"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Peer-to-peer streams": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "P2P 片源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick a name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取个名字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick which AIOMetadata catalogues get a row on Home. None show until you add them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择哪些 AIOMetadata 目录在首页显示栏目。在你添加之前都不会显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick your colour": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择你的颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Picked automatically when a video starts and the file has a matching track. Forced and hearing-impaired tracks are used only if nothing else matches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "视频开始播放且文件中有匹配轨道时自动选择。仅在无其他匹配时才会使用强制字幕和听障字幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Picture in Picture": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画中画"
          }
        }
      }
    },
