      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跳过前情提要"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip buttons use community timestamps from TheIntroDB. When a show has none, the manual button jumps ahead by the chosen time. It's off by default; set a time above 0 to turn it on. Turn Liquid Glass off if playback ever feels heavy on an older device. Turning Picture in Picture off removes its button and stops videos from floating when you leave the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跳过按钮使用 TheIntroDB 的社区时间点。剧集没有时间点时，手动按钮会按所选时长快进。该功能默认关闭；将时长设为大于 0 即可开启。如果在旧设备上播放感觉卡顿，可关闭液态玻璃。关闭画中画会移除其按钮，离开 App 时视频也不再悬浮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip for now": {
      "localizations": {
