    "Status": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stream": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "片源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Studio": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "制作公司"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subtitles": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe a source to pin it to the top for this show.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左滑某个片源，可为该剧集置顶。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch off anything you don't want suggested. It is hidden from Home, Explore and recommendations.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭你不想被推荐的内容，它会从首页、发现和推荐中隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch off the regions you don't want suggested. They only affect live-action: anime and cartoons are handled below. English-language titles are never hidden by these.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭你不想被推荐的地区。它们只影响真人内容，动漫和卡通在下方单独处理。英语影片永远不会被这些设置隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to this profile": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到此用户"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sync now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即同步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Synced with Simkl": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已与 Simkl 同步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Syncing…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在同步…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Syncs your library and watch history, and uses your Simkl name and picture. You enter a code on simkl.com/pin; no account setup needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步你的媒体库和观看记录，并使用你的 Simkl 名称和头像。你在 simkl.com/pin 输入验证码，无需注册。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Synopsis": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "简介"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System (no accent)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统（无强调色）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TMDB API key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TMDB API 密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TMDB is already built in. MDBList and TheTVDB use your own free API keys, which stay on this device. You can add or change any of them later in Settings → Integrations.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TMDB 已内置。MDBList 和 TheTVDB 使用你自己的免费 API 密钥，密钥会留在本机。之后可在「设置 → 集成」中添加或更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TMDB key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TMDB 密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TMDB, TheTVDB, MDBList and Simkl: API keys, logins and metadata sources.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TMDB、TheTVDB、MDBList 和 Simkl：API 密钥、登录和元数据来源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TOP RATED": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TV Show": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剧集"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TV movies": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电视电影"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TVDB API key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TVDB API 密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk shows & news": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "脱口秀与新闻"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Add to Watchlist on any title to save it to %@'s library. Connect Simkl in Settings to sync across devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任意影片上点「加入待看清单」，即可保存到 %@ 的媒体库。在设置中连接 Simkl 可跨设备同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Connect to Simkl, then enter the code at simkl.com/pin. No account setup, keys or redirects needed. Your library syncs when the app opens and only downloads what changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点「连接 Simkl」，然后在 simkl.com/pin 输入验证码。无需注册、密钥或重定向。App 打开时会同步媒体库，且只下载有变化的部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The clipboard has no settings text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剪贴板中没有设置文本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file contains your API keys and add-on URLs, so keep it private. The clipboard options are a fallback if the file picker won't open a backup: the copied text includes your keys too, and is removed from the clipboard after 5 minutes. The Simkl login isn't included; reconnect it after importing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件包含你的 API 密钥和插件地址，请妥善保管。如果文件选择器无法打开备份，可用剪贴板方式作为备选：复制的文本同样包含密钥，并会在 5 分钟后从剪贴板清除。Simkl 登录不包含在内，导入后需重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The link may have expired or the server may be refusing the request. Try another source, or open this one in another player.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "链接可能已过期，或服务器拒绝了请求。试试其他片源，或用其他播放器打开这个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TheTVDB key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TheTVDB 密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Themed collections": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题合集"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These stay in the pill while it is folded. Everything else slides out to the left when you tap the arrow, and folds back after 5 seconds. A button only shows when it applies: Episodes for shows, Next for series, Audio when there is more than one track.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "胶囊折叠时这些按钮保留在外面。点箭头后其余按钮向左滑出，5 秒后自动收回。按钮只在其适用时显示：剧集显示「集数」，连载剧显示「下一集」，音轨多于一条时显示「音频」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This account has no Plex servers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此账户没有 Plex 服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This add-on offers no catalogues that can sit on Home. Add some on its setup page, then reload.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此插件没有可放在首页的目录。请在其设置页添加一些，然后重新加载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is how subtitles look": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字幕效果预览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is how your profile is shown. You can add more profiles later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是你的用户显示方式。之后可以添加更多用户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本产品使用 TMDB API，但未获得 TMDB 的认可或认证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Titles in your own libraries show up as sources, ahead of your add-ons, whenever you open a movie or episode they have. Switch a server off to stop using it without signing out; touch and hold it to hide its rows from Home or remove it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开某部电影或剧集时，你自有媒体库中匹配的影片会作为片源排在所有插件之前。停用服务器可以在不登出的情况下停止使用；长按可隐藏它在首页的栏目或将其移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Titles you add on Simkl show up here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在 Simkl 上添加的影片会显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top rated": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最高评分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Torrent streams connect directly to other peers, so your IP address is visible to them. A VPN is recommended. Nothing runs until you play a P2P stream.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "种子片源会直接连接其他节点，因此对方能看到你的 IP 地址。建议使用 VPN。在你播放 P2P 片源之前，不会启动任何连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Torrents can't be downloaded": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "种子无法下载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total watch time": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "总观看时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trailers & Extras": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预告片与花絮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trending %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "热门%@"
          }
        }
