          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "依据 TMDB API 使用条款使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used under the TheTVDB API terms of use": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "依据 TheTVDB API 使用条款使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Username": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用户名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Using the library on this device. Connect Simkl in Integrations to use it as your library or to sync with it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在使用本机媒体库。在「集成」中连接 Simkl，即可将其作为媒体库或与之同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Using your key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用你的密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Video player engine (FFmpeg demuxing, VideoToolbox decoding).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "视频播放引擎（FFmpeg 解封装、VideoToolbox 解码）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View %@'s profile": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看 %@ 的用户资料"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Volume": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for approval…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待批准…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for authorisation…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待授权…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for connection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for you to sign in…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待你登录…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting to download": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待下载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch history and Continue Watching are kept separately for each profile. This profile's library comes from Simkl, so profiles set to Simkl share it. Switch a profile to its own library in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "观看记录和「继续观看」按用户分别保存。此用户的媒体库来自 Simkl，因此设置为 Simkl 的用户会共享它。可在设置中将某个用户切换为独立的媒体库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch offline": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离线观看"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch something and your favourite times of day will show up here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "看点什么之后，你最喜欢的时段会显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watched": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已看"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watching": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "观看中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weight": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字重"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weighted by time spent, so a long series counts for more than a short film.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按时长加权，所以长篇剧集比短片更有分量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Pear. is, and the open-source components and services it uses.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pear. 是什么，以及它使用的开源组件和服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What do you want to see?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你想看什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you watch": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "观看时段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where it's from": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where it's from · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来源 · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who's watching?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "谁在看？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi only": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅 Wi-Fi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working it out…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在计算…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "年份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also touch and hold a row's title on Home and choose Hide this row.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你也可以在首页长按栏目标题并选择「隐藏此栏目」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don't need to provide a key. Pear. already includes one, so trending, Explore, recommendations, episode thumbnails, title logos and skip-intro matching work out of the box. If something doesn't load, turn on the switch below and add your own free key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你无需提供密钥。Pear. 已内置一个，因此热门、发现、推荐、剧集缩略图、片名台标和跳过片头匹配都可直接使用。如果有内容加载不出来，请打开下方的开关并添加你自己的免费密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You sign in on Plex's own page, so your password never goes through this app. Come back here afterwards and your servers are listed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在 Plex 自己的页面上登录，密码绝不会经过此 App。完成后回到这里，你的服务器就会列出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You watch what's new": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你看的都是新片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're all set, %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "都设置好了，%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're back online": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已恢复联网"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前离线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your content settings are hiding everything here. Change them in Settings → Content & catalogues.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的内容设置隐藏了这里的所有内容。请在「设置 → 内容与目录」中修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your library is empty": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的媒体库是空的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own TMDB key (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你自己的 TMDB 密钥（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own library and watch tracking on this device. Nothing is sent to Simkl.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在本机使用你自己的媒体库和观看记录，不会向 Simkl 发送任何内容。"
